	(text "Measure steady-state worst case amps and revisit the fuse only if needed.\nThe current, higher PTC value means weaker protection against moderate overloads,\nbut good for hard-faults.\nUse premade soft power switch board. Also allows for MCU-assisted shutdown procedure (save before shutdown)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
